---
import building from "/public/images/udbhav-developers-logo-1.png";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 via-white to-orange-50 py-28">

    <!-- Background Blur -->
    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-red-100 blur-[120px] opacity-40"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

        <div class="grid items-center gap-20 lg:grid-cols-2">

            <!-- Left -->

            <div class="relative">

                <img
                    src={building.src}
                    alt=""
                    class="rounded-[40px] shadow-2xl"
                />

                <!-- Floating Experience Card -->

                <div
                    class="absolute -right-8 top-10 rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl">

                    <h2 class="text-6xl font-bold text-[#0F2343]">

                        13+

                    </h2>

                    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">

                        Years of Excellence

                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Right -->

            <div>

                <span
                    class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-red-600">

                    About Udbhav Developers

                </span>

                <h2
                    class="mt-6 text-5xl font-bold leading-tight text-[#142543]">

                    Building Trust.
                    <br>

                    Creating Landmarks.

                </h2>

                <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-9 text-gray-600">

                 Udbhav Developers is a founder-led boutique real estate firm committed to creating refined residential and commercial spaces that combine thoughtful design, structural integrity, and long-term value. Established with a clear vision and guided by disciplined execution, the company focuses on select developments in prime locations, ensuring that every project reflects clarity of purpose and uncompromising quality.




                </p>

                <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-9 text-gray-600">

                    Every project reflects thoughtful planning, functional
                    design, and sustainable value, creating spaces that
                    homeowners and investors can rely on for generations.

                </p>

                <!-- Stats -->

                <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6">

                    <div>

                        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-600">

                            13+

                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">

                            Years

                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-600">

                            50+

                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">

                            Projects

                        </p>

                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-red-600">

                            500+

                        </h3>

                        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500">

                            Families

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <a
                    href="/portfolio"
                    class="mt-12 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-red-600 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-red-700">

                    Explore Projects →

                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>